  "releaseNotes": "Improved Light theme styling and consistency.\n      Improved TabControl selection styling and animations.\n      Improved DataGrid selection styling and column headers.\n      Added styling and navigation transitions for Frame.\n      Improved theme-aware control states and visual refinements.\n      Various styling fixes and refinements.",
